# Darkness Rising (Bastok 5-1, mission.bastok.darkness_rising) played through: a level 75 Bastokan at rank 5, ACP and
# RoV current (their zone-ins quiet) and the nation's missions before it completed, the Message to Jeuno held. Malduc
# 1007 (progress); Naji 720, option 0: begun, the message taken, the New Fei'Yin Seal, status 10; Naji's default 700
# (Metalworks DefaultActions) where the mission has nothing. Fei'Yin's zone-in 1 (status 11). Qu'Bia Arena: BC_Entrance
# 32000, area 1; the Archlich killed: allDeath, WON; the win's 32001, whose finish runs the battlefield's (Archmage
# Assassin) and the mission's (the Burnt Seal, status 12, the seal taken). Naji 722: completed (600 rank points, the
# Burnt Seal taken); then Naji's default 700.
